OL,3,GNEWSAFM warns police will pursue anyone
OL,4,Aspreading lies about fire-hit flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister has warned that
OL,7,Fpolice will pursue anyone who spreads
OL,8,Fmisinformation suggesting asylum
OL,9,Fseekers were due to use flats in
OL,10,FGlasgow which were later set on fire.
OL,12,FThe blaze broke out on Sunday at a
OL,13,Fbuilding in Stonyhurst Street,
OL,14,FPossilpark, which had been targeted by
OL,15,Fanti-immigration protests in recent
OL,16,Fmonths.
OL,18,FSome #3m of public money had been put
OL,19,Ftowards renovating the tenement - which
OL,20,Fhas been derelict for 20 years - to
OL,21,Fcreate affordable homes.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
