OL,3,GNEWSAFM warns police will pursue anyone
OL,4,Aspreading lies about fire-hit flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeculation has spread online that the
OL,7,Ffire was started deliberately over
OL,8,Fconcerns the building would be used to
OL,9,Fhouse asylum seekers, a claim which has
OL,10,Fbeen rejected by operator NG Homes.
